# Do NOT re-add a broad "*trace*" pattern — it silently hid real source
# files (engines/DebugTrace.js, engines/DebugTraceToggle.js) and a real
# test (reportforge/tests/test_coercion_traceability.py) for an unknown
# period of time, since gitignore matches *trace* against any path
# component, not just generated trace/log dumps. If a real trace-dump
# artifact needs ignoring, use a specific, anchored pattern instead, e.g.
# *.trace.log or /trace-dumps/ — never a bare substring wildcard.
